<title>USA: Ibis receives contracts valued at $900,000.</title>
<headline>Ibis receives contracts valued at $900,000.</headline>
<dateline>DANVERS, Mass. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ibis Technology Corp said Wednesday it received $900,000 in contracts from the National Science Foundation and the Defense Special Weapons Agency.</p>
<p>National Science Foundation has offered a two year $300,000 contract while the Defense Special Weapons Agency will supply a two year $600,000 contract.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
